MAJOR_VERSION=5
STANDARD_VERSION=3
RELEASE_VERSION=0
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=13
RERELEASE=1
DESCRIPTION=FL-02 stage 2: KeyQuorum-signed file histories in the freestanding image. The bss moves above 1 MiB (linker.ld links it at FL_KERNEL_BSS_ADDR, 0x100000, and never loads it); stage 2 refuses to boot unless one usable E820 entry holds it (FLINTSTONE_BOOT_FAIL bss-memory), the boot info reserves the image and the bss as two ranges, and fl_bootinfo_validate checks both, so the loaded image ends at 0x8aa60 (0x87440 security lab) with room below 0x9f000. The kernel stack grows to 24 KiB (0xa000). The checkpoints run in the default image over the in-memory storage table kq_mem_storage.c: the placement layer, the shared folder's quarantine gate and the container mutex are hosted-only, kq_platform.c supplies strcmp, strnlen, strrchr, strtoul, a small snprintf and the clock as KeyQuorum UTC text, fl_fs_join_path and the reserved-suffix check become shared header inlines, and the image's trust table holds 8 signers. Two new checkpoints: fl_kq_cp_track_with starts a history with a signed first revision (sharing one check-in core with encode) and fl_kq_cp_head_trusted_with asks KeyQuorum whether the head is trusted under the file's policy and the keys the store holds. kq_identity.c keeps each account's signing public key as the image's key directory, and kq_files.c adds server file sign (asks for the password, opens the sealed key for that one signature, wipes it), log and verify; the driver's head_author op is now in the image, the shell wipes a typed password from its buffers, and FILE_KQ_ELSEWHERE names the new verbs. The image prints CAP keyquorum-history=ok after a boot self-test. Tests: test_kq_checkpoint (track, trust, a wrong key under another name, fork, missing file), test_fs_bootmap (bss refusals), and under QEMU make test-freestanding-kq-history (wrong password, two signed revisions, log, verify, Root reads but cannot sign over Flinstone's head, the old revision after passwd), with test-freestanding-shell and test_freestanding_entry unchanged and passing.
